###  https://w3id.org/fdso/#StateExecutiveCommittee
<https://w3id.org/fdso/#StateExecutiveCommittee> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/fdso/#StateLevelCommittee> ;
                                                 rdfs:comment "A committee at the state level that comprises of secretaries from various Ministries/Departments headed by a chaiperson to assist the disaster management authority to discharge of its functions."@en ,
                                                              "SEC"@en ;
                                                 rdfs:label "StateExecutiveCommittee"@en .


